  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8450;</mi><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>112</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>&#8450;</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Then,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></munder><mo>(</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">Re</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;is equal to&nbsp; ________</p>",
    "image": null
