  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8450;</mi><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>112</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>&#8450;</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></math></p><p>Let</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Also,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p>Set A:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>112</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>112</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>112</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>56</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>Set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><mo>Rez</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>Im</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></math></p>",
